the text of "the L4 source sale-contract.l4" is at "sources/sale-contract.l4".

something happens on day a day if
    a party does deliver the goods on day the day.

something happens on day a day if
    the clock reaches day the day.

something happens on day a day if
    a party does pay the invoice on day the day.

something happens on day a day if
    a party does cancel the order on day the day.

an obligation can start on day a day if
    something happens on day the day.

a party does something on day a day if
    the party does deliver the goods on day the day.

a party does something on day a day if
    the party does pay the invoice on day the day.

a party does something on day a day if
    the party does cancel the order on day the day.

an obligation can start on day a day if
    the contract the sale contract starts on day the day.

the obligation that the sale contract obliges the_seller to deliver the goods by day a due day D as its first obligation starts on day a day N if
    the contract the sale contract starts on day N
    and D = N + 14.

the obligation that the sale contract obliges a party to deliver the goods by day a due day D as its first obligation is met on day a day N if
    the party does deliver the goods on day N
    and the obligation that the sale contract obliges the party to deliver the goods by day D as its first obligation starts on day a day M
    and M < N
    and N <= D.

the obligation that the sale contract obliges the_buyer to pay the invoice by day a due day D as its second obligation starts on day a day N if
    the obligation that the sale contract obliges a party to deliver the goods by day a second due day as its first obligation ends on day N
    and the party does deliver the goods on day N
    and D = N + 30.

the obligation that the sale contract permits the_seller to cancel the order as its third obligation starts on day a day if
    the obligation that the sale contract obliges a party to deliver the goods by day a due day as its first obligation is missed on day the day.

the obligation that the sale contract obliges a party to deliver the goods by day a due day as its first obligation has deadline day the due day if
    the obligation that the sale contract obliges the party to deliver the goods by day the due day as its first obligation starts on day a day.

the obligation that the sale contract obliges a party to pay the invoice by day a due day D as its second obligation is met on day a day N if
    the party does pay the invoice on day N
    and the obligation that the sale contract obliges the party to pay the invoice by day D as its second obligation starts on day a day M
    and M < N
    and N <= D.

the contract is fulfilled if
    the obligation that the sale contract obliges a party to pay the invoice by day a due day as its second obligation ends on day a day
    and the party does pay the invoice on day the day.

the contract is breached if
    the obligation that the sale contract obliges a party to pay the invoice by day a due day as its second obligation is missed on day a day.

the obligation that the sale contract obliges a party to pay the invoice by day a due day as its second obligation has deadline day the due day if
    the obligation that the sale contract obliges the party to pay the invoice by day the due day as its second obligation starts on day a day.

the obligation that the sale contract permits a party to cancel the order as its third obligation is met on day a day D if
    the party does cancel the order on day D
    and the obligation that the sale contract permits the party to cancel the order as its third obligation starts on day a day N
    and N < D.

the contract is fulfilled if
    the obligation that the sale contract permits a party to cancel the order as its third obligation ends on day a day
    and the party does cancel the order on day the day.

the deadline of the obligation that the sale contract obliges a party to deliver the goods by day a due day as its first obligation has passed on day a day D if
    the obligation that the sale contract obliges the party to deliver the goods by day the due day as its first obligation starts on day a day N
    and the obligation that the sale contract obliges the party to deliver the goods by day the due day as its first obligation has deadline day a day M
    and something happens on day D
    and N < D
    and D > M.

the obligation that the sale contract obliges a party to deliver the goods by day a due day as its first obligation ends on day a day D if
    the obligation that the sale contract obliges the party to deliver the goods by day the due day as its first obligation is met on day D
    and it is not the case that
        the obligation that the sale contract obliges the party to deliver the goods by day the due day as its first obligation is met on day a day N
        and N < D.

the obligation that the sale contract obliges a party to deliver the goods by day a due day as its first obligation is missed on day a day D if
    the deadline of the obligation that the sale contract obliges the party to deliver the goods by day the due day as its first obligation has passed on day D
    and it is not the case that the obligation that the sale contract obliges the party to deliver the goods by day the due day as its first obligation ends on day a second day
    and it is not the case that
        the deadline of the obligation that the sale contract obliges the party to deliver the goods by day the due day as its first obligation has passed on day a day N
        and N < D.

the obligation that the sale contract obliges a party to deliver the goods by day a due day as its first obligation is pending since day a day if
    the obligation that the sale contract obliges the party to deliver the goods by day the due day as its first obligation starts on day the day
